## 1. Purpose
This software is made open-source to provide complete transparency, safety verification, and auditability for root-level Android kernel input injection and companion client control systems. 

This license allows you to use, study, audit, compile, modify, and run this software for any noncommercial purpose, while strictly reserving all commercial exploitation rights to the original author (`sirvkrm`).

